---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Kentaro Sugiura — Drive" description="AI、モビリティ、教育。そしてその先にある社会へ。杉浦健太郎のパーソナルポートフォリオサイト。">
<main data-screen-label="HOME">

<div style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(21,21,21,.12)">
<div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(820px 600px at 76% 4%,#F9F0CE 0%,rgba(249,240,206,0) 68%),radial-gradient(560px 440px at 2% 88%,#FBF5DE 0%,rgba(251,245,222,0) 70%)"></div>
<div class="u-container" style="position:relative;padding:64px 56px 72px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:48px" data-patch="home-hero-pad">
<div style="flex:1;min-width:0;max-width:440px" data-patch="home-hero-text">
<h1 class="u-fs-96" style="margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'Parisienne',cursive;font-weight:400;line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:.02em;color:#151515;animation:riseIn .9s .1s both ease-out">Drive</h1>
<div style="width:64px;height:3px;background:#3B82C4;margin:0 0 30px;animation:riseIn .9s .2s both ease-out"></div>
<p class="u-fs-18" style="margin:0;line-height:2.05;color:rgba(21,21,21,.74);animation:riseIn .9s .3s both ease-out">AI、モビリティ、教育。<br>そしてその先にある社会へ。</p>
</div>
<div style="position:relative;flex:none;width:420px;height:420px" data-patch="particle-field-box">
<particle-field class="c-211" count="1800" shapes="🦕,globe,🏯,🚗,AI,~🗾" hold="4200" scale="0.96" color="#151515" accent="#3B82C4"></particle-field>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div style="position:relative;background:#070B16;overflow:hidden;border-top:1px solid rgba(201,169,97,.2);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(201,169,97,.2)">
<div style="position:absolute;right:0;top:0;width:78%;height:100%">
<journey-scene class="c-211"></journey-scene>
<div style="position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:100%;height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#070B16 0%,rgba(7,11,22,.9) 22%,rgba(7,11,22,.35) 46%,rgba(7,11,22,0) 66%);pointer-events:none"></div>
</div>

<div class="u-container" style="position:relative;padding:78px 56px 86px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,.58fr);gap:40px;align-items:start;min-height:460px">
<div>
<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:30px;margin-bottom:34px" data-patch="home-intro-row">
<div style="position:relative;width:212px;height:212px;flex:none;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">
<div class="u-pill" style="position:absolute;inset:-26px;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(201,169,97,.3),rgba(201,169,97,.06) 55%,rgba(7,11,22,0) 76%)"></div>
<div class="u-pill" style="position:absolute;inset:-9px;border:1px solid rgba(201,169,97,.32)"></div>
<div class="u-pill" style="position:relative;width:212px;height:212px;border:2px solid rgba(216,185,121,.85);background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 34%,rgba(255,253,245,.13),rgba(255,253,245,.04) 60%,rgba(255,253,245,.02));overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;box-shadow:0 0 34px rgba(201,169,97,.28),0 0 0 1px rgba(7,11,22,.9) inset,0 30px 56px -28px rgba(0,0,0,.95)">
<img src="/images/profile/photo-kentaro.jpg" alt="杉浦健太郎" style="position:absolute;width:545px;height:726px;left:-158px;top:-336px;display:block">
</div>
</div>
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:18px">
<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap">
<span style="width:26px;height:1px;background:rgba(201,169,97,.7)"></span>
<span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.26em;color:rgba(226,197,140,.9)">INTRODUCTION</span>
</div>
<a href="/profile/" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#E2C58C;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(201,169,97,.45);padding-bottom:5px;white-space:nowrap;transition:transform .45s cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1),color .3s ease,border-color .35s ease,letter-spacing .45s cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1)" style-hover="transform:translateX(6px);color:#F5E2B4;border-color:#D9B979;letter-spacing:.19em">VIEW FULL "PROFILE" →</a>
</div>
</div>

<h2 class="u-fs-41" style="margin:0 0 24px;font-family:'Shippori Mincho B1',serif;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:.06em;line-height:1.45;color:#F6F2E7">はじめまして。<br>杉浦健太郎です。</h2>
<p class="u-pretty" style="margin:0 0 26px;max-width:540px;font-family:'Shippori Mincho B1',serif;font-size:16.5px;font-weight:400;line-height:2.05;letter-spacing:.05em;color:rgba(244,240,229,.86)">愛知県で生まれ育ち、現在は「地域創生」を目標に、さまざまなことに挑戦しています。</p>
<div style="width:64px;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(201,169,97,.85),rgba(201,169,97,0));margin-bottom:26px"></div>
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;max-width:540px">
<p class="u-pretty" style="margin:0;font-family:'Shippori Mincho B1',serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;line-height:2.05;letter-spacing:.04em;color:rgba(244,240,229,.76)">このページでは、これまでの経験や挑戦、そしてその中で感じたことを、私自身の「軌跡」としてまとめました。</p>
<p class="u-pretty" style="margin:0;font-family:'Shippori Mincho B1',serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;line-height:2.05;letter-spacing:.04em;color:rgba(244,240,229,.6)">どんなことに興味を持ち、何に悩み、何を目指してきたのか。</p>
<p class="u-pretty" style="margin:0;font-family:'Shippori Mincho B1',serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;line-height:2.05;letter-spacing:.04em;color:rgba(244,240,229,.76)">私のこれまでの歩みを通して、少しでも私の「為人（ひととなり）」を感じていただけたら嬉しいです。</p>
<p class="u-pretty" style="margin:0;font-family:'Shippori Mincho B1',serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;line-height:2.05;letter-spacing:.04em;color:rgba(244,240,229,.6)">ぜひ、少しだけお付き合いください。</p>
</div>
</div>

<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-end;text-align:right;padding-top:10px">
<div class="u-fs-46" style="font-family:'Parisienne',cursive;line-height:1.35;letter-spacing:.03em;color:#D9B979;text-shadow:0 0 26px rgba(201,169,97,.35)">My Journey,<br>My Story.</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="u-container" style="padding:96px 56px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(21,21,21,.12)">
<div class="c-182">
<div><div>
<div class="c-104">
<span class="c-115"></span>
<div class="c-023">SELECTED WORKS</div>
</div>
<div class="u-fs-30" style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho B1',serif;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.04em;line-height:1.3">これまでの活動内容。</div>
</div></div>
<a href="/works/" class="c-012" style-hover="transform:translateX(6px);color:#2A6BA6;border-color:#3B82C4;letter-spacing:.19em">To "WORKS" →</a>
</div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:36px">
<a href="/works/mobility/" class="c-019" style-hover="transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:0 2px 4px rgba(21,21,21,.07),0 22px 44px -12px rgba(21,21,21,.22)">
<div class="c-070"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/works/mobility-city-illustration.png" alt="人とロボットが行き交う街" class="c-179" /><span class="c-046">ROBOT IN THE CITY</span></div>
<div class="c-151">
<div class="c-130">
<span class="c-121"></span>
<span class="c-086">大学時代 / UNIVERSITY</span>
</div>
<div class="c-124"><span class="c-058">01</span><span class="u-fs-17" style="font-weight:700">モビリティ研究</span></div>
<p class="c-144">人でいっぱいの街で、<br>ロボットはどう動くべきか。</p>
</div>
</a>
<a href="/works/aiwork/" class="c-019" style-hover="transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:0 2px 4px rgba(21,21,21,.07),0 22px 44px -12px rgba(21,21,21,.22)">
<div class="c-070"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/works/ai-work-illustration.png" alt="AIエージェントと働くオフィス" class="c-180" /><span class="c-046">AI AGENT AT WORK</span></div>
<div class="c-151">
<div class="c-130">
<span class="c-121"></span>
<span class="c-086">キャリア / CAREER</span>
</div>
<div class="c-124"><span class="c-058">02</span><span class="u-fs-17" style="font-weight:700">AI × 仕事</span></div>
<p class="c-144">AIで、仕事のつくり方を変える。</p>
</div>
</a>
<a href="/works/education/" class="c-019" style-hover="transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:0 2px 4px rgba(21,21,21,.07),0 22px 44px -12px rgba(21,21,21,.22)">
<div class="c-070"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/works/ai-education-illustration.png" alt="AIを学び合う教室" class="c-181" /><span class="c-046">AI × EDUCATION</span></div>
<div class="c-151">
<div class="c-130">
<span class="c-121"></span>
<span class="c-086">ボランティア / VOLUNTEER</span>
</div>
<div class="c-124"><span class="c-058">03</span><span class="u-fs-17" style="font-weight:700">AI × 教育</span><span class="u-pill" style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.1em;border:1px solid rgba(21,21,21,.28);padding:2px 7px;color:rgba(21,21,21,.62)">COMING SOON</span></div>
<p class="c-144">未来をつくる人を、増やす。</p>
</div>
</a>
</div>
</div>

<div class="c-063">
<div class="u-container" style="padding:96px 56px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,440px) minmax(0,1fr);gap:64px;align-items:center">
<div style="position:relative;aspect-ratio:4/5;overflow:hidden;border-radius:16px;background:#F7F2E6"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/story/story-setback-illustration.png" alt="机に向かって悩む姿と、そこから歩き出す姿" style="position:absolute;inset:0;display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 54%" /></div>
<div>
<div style="margin-bottom:26px"><div>
<div class="c-104">
<span class="c-115"></span>
<div class="c-023">STORY</div>
</div>
<div class="u-fs-30" style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho B1',serif;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.04em;line-height:1.3">自分を変えた、挫折。</div>
</div></div>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px;font-size:16px;line-height:2.05;color:rgba(21,21,21,.76)">努力量だけでは埋まらない差がある。そう気づいてから、「何をするか」ではなく「なぜそれをするのか」を考えるようになりました。</p>
<a href="/story/" class="c-012" style-hover="transform:translateX(6px);color:#2A6BA6;border-color:#3B82C4;letter-spacing:.19em">READ THE "STORY" →</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="u-container" style="padding:96px 56px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(21,21,21,.12)">
<div class="c-182">
<div><div>
<div class="c-104">
<span class="c-115"></span>
<div class="c-023">GOAL</div>
</div>
<div class="u-fs-30" style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho B1',serif;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.04em;line-height:1.3">これから挑戦したいこと。</div>
</div></div>
<a href="/goal/" class="c-012" style-hover="transform:translateX(6px);color:#2A6BA6;border-color:#3B82C4;letter-spacing:.19em">To "GOAL" →</a>
</div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.92fr) minmax(0,1.08fr);gap:56px;align-items:center">
<div>
<iframe src="/legacy-pages/japan-glow.html" title="日本地図 — 地方中枢都市から地域へ広がる光" scrolling="no" loading="lazy" class="c-191"></iframe>
</div>
<div>
<div style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.26em;color:#3B82C4;margin-bottom:16px">REGIONAL REVITALIZATION</div>
<div class="u-fs-56" style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho B1',serif;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.1em;line-height:1.2">地域創生</div>
<div style="width:72px;height:2px;background:#3B82C4;margin:22px 0 30px"></div>
<p class="u-pretty u-fs-27" style="margin:0 0 24px;max-width:560px;font-family:'Shippori Mincho B1',serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.7;letter-spacing:.03em">生まれ育った地域から、挑戦が生まれる状態をつくる。</p>
<p class="u-pretty" style="margin:0;max-width:560px;font-size:16px;line-height:2.05;color:rgba(21,21,21,.78)">東京への一極集中ではなく、それぞれの地域が自分たちの強みで動き出す。まずは私の地元の名古屋を起点に、東海そして中部地方の発展に寄与する活動を行いたいと考えています。</p>
</div>
</div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:36px;margin-top:64px">
<div class="c-127">
<div class="c-125"><span class="c-058">01</span><span class="c-020">挑戦が生まれる</span><span class="c-087">CHALLENGE</span></div>
<p class="c-116">何かをはじめようとする人が、地域の中から出てくる。</p>
</div>
<div class="c-127">
<div class="c-125"><span class="c-058">02</span><span class="c-020">人が集まり、残る</span><span class="c-087">PEOPLE</span></div>
<p class="c-116">出ていくしかない場所ではなく、生活し続けたい地域、戻ってきたい地域、そして住み続けたい地域に。</p>
</div>
<div class="c-127">
<div class="c-125"><span class="c-058">03</span><span class="c-020">新しい価値が生まれ続ける</span><span class="c-087">CIRCULATION</span></div>
<p class="c-116">生まれた価値を、また次の挑戦に回していく。</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="c-215" data-patch="dream-city-wrap">
<div style="position:sticky;top:0;height:100vh;overflow:hidden">
<dream-city cycle="26" start="evening" class="c-216"></dream-city>
</div>
</div>


<div class="u-container" style="padding:126px 56px 136px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center;gap:26px">
<div class="u-fs-29" style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.26em;color:rgba(21,21,21,.62)" data-charfx="46">CONTACT</div>
<p style="margin:0;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:rgba(21,21,21,.72)" data-charfx="32" data-charfx-delay="260">LET'S BUILD SOMETHING.</p>
<a href="/contact/" class="u-fs-18" style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.14em;text-decoration:none;color:#FFFDF5;background:#151515;padding:22px 44px;display:inline-block;transition:background .35s ease,transform .4s cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1),box-shadow .4s ease" style-hover="background:#3B82C4;transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 16px 30px -14px rgba(59,130,196,.55)">GET IN TOUCH →</a>
</div>
</main>

<script>
import '../scripts/web-components/particle-field.js';
import '../scripts/web-components/journey-scene.js';
import '../scripts/web-components/dream-city.js';
import '../scripts/home-effects.js';
</script>
</Layout>
